  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 67e749f2b7d7bc244ac0f5a2749ac2ee, type: 3}
  m_Name: Piano
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  contentList:
  - I hope you're excited for Christmas just like I am!  I wanna this new piano to
    practice with my mom. Love you!
  - I hope your sleigh is almost ready for Christmas Eve!  I would love a new piano
    so I can practice songs with my mom. It would mean a lot to me. Love you, Santa!
  - "I hope you are not too busy getting all the presents ready!  I\u2019m dreaming
    of a big instrument with black and white teeth that sings when touched."
